('node-13-5', 'phase-13-lesson-05-track-a-global-multi-tenant-billing-tax-c', 'module-14', 5, 'Lesson 14.5: Track A: Global Multi-Tenant Billing, Tax Compliance & Invoicing', 'Prerequisites: Phase 5, Phase 6, Lesson 6.40', 'Prerequisites: Phase 5, Phase 6, Lesson 6.40 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 360, 14, 3370.0, 250.0, '# Lesson 13.5: Track A: Global Multi-Tenant Billing, Tax Compliance & Invoicing

- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
