('node-13-9', 'phase-13-lesson-09-track-b-distributed-orchestration-with-ra', 'module-14', 9, 'Lesson 14.9: Track B: Distributed Orchestration with Ray: Clusters, Actors & Workflows', 'Prerequisites: Phase 7, Lesson 13.6', 'Prerequisites: Phase 7, Lesson 13.6 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 360, 14, 3250.0, 450.0, '# Lesson 13.9: Track B: Distributed Orchestration with Ray: Clusters, Actors & Workflows

